#   * patch (2.2.x): bug fix only, no contract change.
#   * minor (2.x.0): additive — new endpoints, new params with defaults.
#                    Existing callers keep working unchanged.
#   * major (x.0.0): removes / renames endpoints, changes response shape.
#
