* **Differential expression** (read-only): `/databases/{{id}}/de`, `/de/{{study}}`, `/de/{{study}}/terms/{{term}}`, `/de/{{study}}/terms/{{term}}/contrasts/{{contrast}}`, `/de/by-gene/{{gene}}`. Ingest via the `ant-de-ingest` CLI.
